{"id":"0e7016d5e6e71f46","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-computable-measure-atoms.md","title":"可计算概率测度的原子可计算","display":"thm-computable-measure-atoms — 可计算概率测度的原子可计算","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-computable-measure-atoms","aliases":["43-thm-computable-measure-atoms"],"display":"thm-computable-measure-atoms — 可计算概率测度的原子可计算","depends_on":["[[43-df-compmeasure]]","[[43-df-measure-atoms]]","[[43-df-computable]]","[[43-df-cylinder]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§9.9.2 Lemma 9.9.6，印刷199–200，PDF219–220；本节点附独立局部证明","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_checked":false,"local_proof_checked":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-computable-measure-atoms"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-computable-measure-atoms</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-computable-measure-atoms — 可计算概率测度的原子可计算"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8abc268dbc50df5d\" href=\"?note=8abc268dbc50df5d\" title=\"43-df-compmeasure\">43-df-compmeasure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6b32588f9bb461b3\" href=\"?note=6b32588f9bb461b3\" title=\"43-df-measure-atoms\">43-df-measure-atoms</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" href=\"?note=ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" title=\"43-df-cylinder\">43-df-cylinder</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§9.9.2 Lemma 9.9.6，印刷199–200，PDF219–220；本节点附独立局部证明"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"local_proof_checked","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu\">\\(\\nu\\)</span> 是满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ComputableMeasure}(\\nu)\">\\(\\operatorname{ComputableMeasure}(\\nu)\\)</span> 的Borel概率测度，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>。可计算测度、原子、柱集及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TotalComputable}(X)\">\\(\\operatorname{TotalComputable}(X)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8abc268dbc50df5d\" href=\"?note=8abc268dbc50df5d\" title=\"43-df-compmeasure\">43-df-compmeasure</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"6b32588f9bb461b3\" href=\"?note=6b32588f9bb461b3\" title=\"43-df-measure-atoms\">43-df-measure-atoms</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" href=\"?note=ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" title=\"43-df-cylinder\">43-df-cylinder</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 视为自然数域上的总二值函数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\operatorname{Atoms}(\\nu)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{TotalComputable}(X).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[X\\in\\operatorname{Atoms}(\\nu)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{TotalComputable}(X).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\operatorname{TotalComputable}(X)\\Rightarrow\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\nu([X\\upharpoonright n])=0.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg\\operatorname{TotalComputable}(X)\\Rightarrow\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\nu([X\\upharpoonright n])=0.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>独立局部证明：令a=ν({X})&gt;0，取有理δ使a/2&lt;δ&lt;a。因ν([X↾n])趋向a，可选有限前缀σ≺X使ν([σ])&lt;2δ。把σ、δ硬编码。对任意沿X的已知延伸τ，两子柱质量之和小于2δ，故至多一个子柱质量大于δ；含X的子柱质量至少a&gt;δ。借统一可计算近似并行搜索发现质量严格大于δ的子柱，即能确定下一位。这样总计算X。第二式由测度从上连续性及第一式的逆否推出。此证明不要求能够统一地从测度索引列出所有原子，也未声称原子质量统一可计算。</p>\n<p>来源：§9.9.2 Lemma 9.9.6，印刷199–200，PDF219–220；本节点附独立局部证明。书内定位仅适用用户提供的2007-07-28草稿；本地推广或推论已单独注明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-compmeasure","status":"resolved","id":"8abc268dbc50df5d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-compmeasure]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-measure-atoms","status":"resolved","id":"6b32588f9bb461b3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-measure-atoms]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-cylinder","status":"resolved","id":"ab1ef7b1cac112c1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-cylinder]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-compmeasure","status":"resolved","id":"8abc268dbc50df5d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $\\nu$ 是满足 $\\operatorname{ComputableMeasure}(\\nu)$ 的Borel概率测度，$X\\in2^\\omega$。可计算测度、原子、柱集及 $\\operatorname{TotalComputable}(X)$ 见 [[43-df-compmeasure]]、[[43-df-measure-atoms]]、[[43-df-cylinder]]、[[43-df-computable]]；$X$ 视为自然数域上的总二值函数。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-measure-atoms","status":"resolved","id":"6b32588f9bb461b3","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $\\nu$ 是满足 $\\operatorname{ComputableMeasure}(\\nu)$ 的Borel概率测度，$X\\in2^\\omega$。可计算测度、原子、柱集及 $\\operatorname{TotalComputable}(X)$ 见 [[43-df-compmeasure]]、[[43-df-measure-atoms]]、[[43-df-cylinder]]、[[43-df-computable]]；$X$ 视为自然数域上的总二值函数。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-cylinder","status":"resolved","id":"ab1ef7b1cac112c1","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $\\nu$ 是满足 $\\operatorname{ComputableMeasure}(\\nu)$ 的Borel概率测度，$X\\in2^\\omega$。可计算测度、原子、柱集及 $\\operatorname{TotalComputable}(X)$ 见 [[43-df-compmeasure]]、[[43-df-measure-atoms]]、[[43-df-cylinder]]、[[43-df-computable]]；$X$ 视为自然数域上的总二值函数。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $\\nu$ 是满足 $\\operatorname{ComputableMeasure}(\\nu)$ 的Borel概率测度，$X\\in2^\\omega$。可计算测度、原子、柱集及 $\\operatorname{TotalComputable}(X)$ 见 [[43-df-compmeasure]]、[[43-df-measure-atoms]]、[[43-df-cylinder]]、[[43-df-computable]]；$X$ 视为自然数域上的总二值函数。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\nu","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ComputableMeasure}(\\nu)","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TotalComputable}(X)","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in\\operatorname{Atoms}(\\nu)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{TotalComputable}(X).","display":true},{"tex":"\\neg\\operatorname{TotalComputable}(X)\\Rightarrow\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\nu([X\\upharpoonright n])=0.","display":true}],"bytes":2052,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-249","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-computable-measure-atoms]] — 可计算概率测度的原子可计算"}],"outgoing":["8abc268dbc50df5d","6b32588f9bb461b3",